  "description": "Software Driver SDK to access SIMATIC S7 PLCs (Programmable Logic Controllers) via TCP/IP. Quick & easy development using .NET Framework and .NET Standard. Simple & familiar .NET API, portability, features, patterns, samples and technical support. Unlimited free evaluation & royalty free licensing. Designed and implemented using Microsoft's Framework Design Guidelines by Traeger in Germany/Bavaria with over 30 years of experience in industrial communication.\n\nFeatures:\n• High Performance Access\n• No PLC knowledge required\n• Optimized S7 Communication\n\nCharacteristics:\n• Simple and fast Development\n• Minimum number of lines of code\n\nTested with:\n• all SIMATIC PLCs\n• and many more other S7 compatible vendors\n\nWorks on:\n• Windows / Ubuntu / Debian / macOS\n• Android / iOS",
